# C Exercises
## About
* This repository is a collection of programs written in C that I have made.
* Each program will focus on a certain area of C such as switch statements, while loops, and more.

## How to Run (Easiest Way)
1. Download/Clone this repository.
2. Install Visual Studio Code (if not already installed).
3. Install the C/C++ extension by Microsoft on VS Code (if not already installed).
4. Open a new terminal (Terminal > New Terminal).
5. Navigate to repository file path using `cd /path/to/folder/example`
6. In the terminal, compile the desired program using `gcc name_of_program.c`
7. Run the program by typing `./a.out`